": [{"widget": {"name": "ckpt_name"}, "name": "ckpt_name", "label": "ckpt_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "ckpt_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "CheckpointLoaderSimple", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CheckpointLoaderSimple"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["🎚️ KSampler 参数说明\n\nseed：随机种子，用于控制可复现性。相同参数 + 相同 seed 可生成完全一致结果。\n\ncontrol_after_generate：\n\nfixed：保持 seed 不变（便于复现）。\n\nrandomize：每次运行自动换种子（用于探索不同构图）。\n\nsteps：采样步数。步数越高细节越多、速度越慢；20–30 是常用区间。\n\ncfg（提示词权重）：控制模型对提示词的“听话程度”。\n\n数值越高，模型越贴近提示词，但易假脸或过锐。\n\n建议范围：6–8（SD1.5）、4–6（SDXL）。\n\nsampler_name：采样算法。\n\n常用 dpmpp_2m_sde（稳、细节好），\n\n或 euler_a（快、风格更松）。\n\nscheduler：步长策略，影响细节分布。\n\nkarras 最通用稳定。\n\ndenoise：去噪强度。\n\n文生图设为 1.0（完全生成）。\n\n图生图或局部重绘设 0.3–0.6（保留更多原图结构）。\n\n💡 小贴士：\n锁构图 → 固定 seed；\n快速灵感探索 → randomize；\n画面太假 → 降 CFG 或换 euler_a。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [527.0718383789062, 505.2200927734375], "pos": [114.34234619140625, 349.6922912597656], "id": 14, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [106], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [380, 262], "pos": [120, 40], "widgets_values": [123456789, "fixed", 28, 3, "dpmpp_2m_sde", "karras", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 105, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 102, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 103, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "negative"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 104, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "ty